      "side": 1,
      "message": "Marco: `av1_free_svc_cyclic_refresh` assumes the `svc-\u003elayer_context` array has been allocated. `svc-\u003elayer_context` is allocated in `av1_alloc_layer_context()`. So we should set `ctx-\u003eppi-\u003euse_svc` to 1 after this `av1_alloc_layer_context()` call.\n\nAlternative fix: We could also change the following code:\n\n```\n  if (cpi-\u003eppi-\u003euse_svc) av1_free_svc_cyclic_refresh(cpi);\n  aom_free(cpi-\u003esvc.layer_context);\n  cpi-\u003esvc.layer_context \u003d NULL;\n```\n\nto\n\n```\n  if (cpi-\u003esvc.layer_context) {\n    av1_free_svc_cyclic_refresh(cpi);\n    aom_free(cpi-\u003esvc.layer_context);\n    cpi-\u003esvc.layer_context \u003d NULL;\n  }\n```",
      "revId": "0ab2b01c1dee1d756f33693ec420218b084b0fd4",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
